# Positive control for "a defeated siege cannot be cast transformed when a spell was cast under archon of emeria": with
# Bot2's Archon of Emeria out ("each player can't cast more than one spell each turn", CR 101.2), the cast of a defeated Siege
# (CR 310.12b) is still allowed when it is the turn's first spell. Bot1's Gorilla takes the last defense counter off Invasion
# of Gobakhan on turn 5 and Bot1 casts it transformed, a Lightshield Array.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Mox Emerald
Guerrilla Gorilla
Plains
Mox Pearl
Invasion of Gobakhan
Plains
Plains
Plains x9

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains
Mox Pearl
Sol Ring
Archon of Emeria
Lightning Bolt
Plains x10

